================================================================================
B. PATCHWORK UNIFICATION (n=14): skip s of AP{1..13}, patch = a MULTIPLE m*s of s.
   The patch kills the resonance hole at D=s. Only two hit the critical M-values.
================================================================================
  floor 1/14=0.07143   covering-min 14/183=0.07650
  skip s | multiples m*s giving notable M
      12 | 24:1/14 <<TIGHT>>
      13 | 182:14/183 <<COVMIN>>

  GW  = AP skip 12 (=n-2), patch 24 = 2(n-2)     : M=1/14 cover=False  [tight LRC floor]
  CON = AP skip 13 (=n-1), patch 182=lcm(13,14)  : M=14/183 cover=True  [covering-min]
  Both patches are multiples of the skipped speed: 24=2*12, 182=14*13.

